      Rollins College
    </h2>
    <div class="text-colorText-body max-w-[84ch] whitespace-pre-line text-center">Ranked the #1 Regional University in the south, Rollins College is a private college in Winter Park, Florida, that needed a video to serve as the creative anchor for Brighter Together—their largest fundraising campaign in over 135 years.</div>
    <div class="text-colorText-body text-center mt-16 flex flex-col gap-0 [&_strong]:text-white">
