        <strong>Video Type:</strong> Fundraising Campaign Production <strong>Company:</strong> Studio Say So <strong>Services:</strong> Creative, Full Production
        <br />
        <strong>Director:</strong> Marshall Head <strong>Producers:</strong> Danny Miller &amp; Mackenzie Wiler <strong>Cinematographer:</strong> Marshall Head <strong>Editor:</strong> Audri Tearpak
      </p>
    </div>
